# German (QWERTZ, ISO).
# Not available (no glyph yet): the umlauts, sharp s, the degree and
# paragraph signs. Dead keys are not supported: ^ and ` type themselves,
# the acute key types nothing.
name German (QWERTZ)
# SC  plain shift altgr
